 "sentences": [
  "Now, when working remotely, never use a VPN to connect to our company network.",
  "Using a VPN can slow down your connection and cause unnecessary complications.",
  "More importantly, it can create security vulnerabilities if not properly configured.",
  "We primarily use Git for version control, so I'll show you how we structure our branches, handle pull requests, and ensure code quality through code reviews.",
  "We'll take it step by step, and feel free to reach out anytime you have questions or concerns.",
  "Now, let's get you set up with the necessary tools and resources first.",
  "Going forward, I need you to use a VPN whenever you're working remotely.",
  "Certainly.",
  "A VPN, or Virtual Private Network, encrypts your internet connection and routes your online activity through a secure server.",
  "It's all part of maintaining the integrity of our systems and data.",
  "Effective commenting is often overlooked, but it's a vital practice for collaboration and future maintenance.",
  "Clear and concise comments can save a lot of time and effort for yourself and your colleagues.",
  "Remember, my goal is to help you develop your skills and navigate any challenges or questions you may have along the way.",
  "That's why I want you to transition away from using a notebook for note-taking.",
  "Notebooks can be cumbersome, easily misplaced, and don't offer the same level of flexibility as digital note-taking tools.",
  "Absolutely.",
  "This helps you think systematically and ensures that your notes are actionable."
 ],
